# This directory MUST exist after a clean `git clone`.
#
# Phase 80 copies the cosign public key here:
#   cp "$SECRETS_TMP/cosign.pub" \
#      "$PLATFORM_DIR/k8s/base/platform/cosign/cosign.pub"
# and further down `cosign verify --key` reads it from this same path.
# Git does not version empty directories: without this marker the `cp`
# fails on a virgin clone and phase 80 dies right after generating the
# keypair, before signing the first image.
#
# Second instance of the same class as platform/tofu/secrets/
# (see the .gitkeep over there). Two appearances = the CLASS gets
# attacked: check 84 of verify-static.sh resolves ALL the init's path
# variables ($PLATFORM_DIR, $B, $TOKENS_DIR, $IU_DIR) and demands
# that every destination directory have at least one versioned file.
